{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "61244d61-c50f-8fdc-9928-b62ac12e908b",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T12:10:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gina Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:07:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:07:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. My name Gina Cardillo. I call about water and sewer bill. Is for 317 Coggeshall Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Cardillo. What do you need to do with the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:07:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I need change mailing address. Bill go to old place, and I never get it on time. Then I get late notice. Very annoying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:08:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. Is the account under your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:08:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. Account still in my husband name. He pass away already. I am renter, I pay the bill, but name is his."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:08:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I can update the mailing address on the account today. What address should the bills go to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:08:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same, 317 Coggeshall. Just send there, not the old one. And I want paperless. No more paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:08:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me note the mailing address change first. [pause] Done. For paperless, I'll need an email address for the bill notices. Do you have one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, but I write it for you? It is long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:08:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can give it to me slowly, and I'll read it back to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:08:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Wait, my phone, the rain, [line breaks up] you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:08:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I lost you for a second. Go ahead, I can hear you now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:08:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, the rain is hitting today, the signal is bad. Maybe I send email later? Is okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:09:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Once you send it, we'll add it to the account. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:09:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Can I pay the bill online tonight? After City Hall closed? I am home at night only."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:09:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's an online payment option that's available around the clock. You can use it tonight. There's also a drop box if you'd rather pay by check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:09:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online is better. And one more thing. I get a rebate in the mail, a check. I forget what it is for. Why they send me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:09:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at the account. [pause] I see a credit adjustment was issued. It may be from an overpayment or a billing correction. Do you have the letter that came with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:09:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only the check, no letter. I think maybe I throw away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:09:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. I'll note the account so the credit is explained on your next statement. If you'd like the details sooner, I can have someone call you back at the number we have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:10:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Call 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:10:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0183. Someone will follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:10:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
